# Act V objectives for tools/playthrough/playthrough.py (spec:
# specs/tools/playthrough.md). Crude, as act1.play: pokes (warp, pos,
# stat, missile) jump between milestones; each milestone is its own
# state-dump run. A boss kill is a Fire Bolt `missile` poke at the boss
# (moved next to the player, life set to 1): the headless right click
# walks instead of casting (spec Open question 2). A boss outside the
# start's active rooms is found by a sweep (`find`) first. The act ends
# at Baal killed in the Worldstone Chamber.
# Quests: specs/world/quests-act5.md, quests-act5-2.md (slots 35 Siege on
# Harrogath, 36 Rescue on Mount Arreat, 37 Prison of Ice, 38 Betrayal of
# Harrogath, 39 Rite of Passage, 40 Eve of Destruction; quests.md §1.3).
# Ids from the 1.14d tables (levels.txt rows, monstats rows, objects.txt
# rows): Harrogath 109, Bloody Foothills 110, Frigid Highlands 111,
# Arreat Plateau 112, Frozen River 114, Halls of Vaught 124, Arreat
# Summit 120, Worldstone Keep 1 = 128, Throne of Destruction 131,
# Worldstone Chamber 132; Larzuk 511, Anya (town) 512, Malah 513,
# Nihlathak (town) 514, Qual-Kehk 515, Deckard Cain (Act V) 520,
# Nihlathak (Halls of Vaught) 526, Anya (frozen) 527, Ancient
# Barbarians 540,541,542, Baal (throne) 543, Baal (Worldstone Chamber)
# 544; Ancients' altar 546, Ancient statues 474,475,476, waypoint objects 119,145,156,157,237,238,
# 288,323,324,398,402,429,494,496,511,539.
playthrough 1
act 5

# Act V town (town byte act 4), Acts I-IV done (acts=4: slots 7, 15, 23, 28 bit 0).
save sor --name PtSorE --class sor --expansion --level 70 --skill 8=20 --right-skill 44 --stat 8=128000 --stat 9=128000 --waypoints all --quests acts=4 --act 4 --difficulty normal

milestone town-start
  use sor
  deadline 40
  note the NPCs 1.14d has at frame 40 (only the start's active rooms; q-prov-data)
  need player lv == 109
  need player act == 4
  need unit ut 1 cl 513 count >= 1
  need unit ut 1 cl 567,568,569 count >= 1

milestone town-wp
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  sweep 20 2 300 30
  need ever player lv == 109
  need unit ut 2 cl 119,145,156,157,237,238,288,323,324,398,402,429,494,496,511,539 lv 109 seen

milestone bloody-foothills
  use sor
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 110
  need player lv == 110
  need unit ut 1 lv 110 count >= 3

milestone frigid-highlands-wp
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 111
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 111
  need unit ut 2 cl 119,145,156,157,237,238,288,323,324,398,402,429,494,496,511,539 lv 111 seen

milestone frozen-anya
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 114
  sweep 20 2 400 40 grid
  need ever player lv == 114
  need unit ut 1 cl 527 lv 114 seen

milestone nihlathak-present
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 124
  sweep 20 2 400 40 grid
  need ever player lv == 124
  need unit ut 1 cl 526 lv 124 seen

milestone nihlathak-killed
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 124
  sweep 20 2 400 40 grid
  find ut 1 cl 526
  poke +2 pos @1:526 @x+3 @y
  poke +2 stat @1:526 6 0 256
  poke +10 missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y skill 36 1
  need ever unit ut 1 cl 526 killed

milestone arreat-summit
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 120
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 120
  need unit ut 2 cl 546 lv 120 seen

milestone ancient-statues
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  note the Ancient Barbarians (540-542) appear only once the altar is used (not poked here)
  poke 5 warp 120
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 120
  need unit ut 2 cl 474,475,476 lv 120 seen

milestone worldstone-keep
  use sor
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 128
  need player lv == 128
  need unit ut 1 lv 128 count >= 3

milestone baal-throne
  use sor
  deadline 1000
  poke 5 warp 131
  sweep 20 2 400 40
  need ever player lv == 131
  need unit ut 1 cl 543 lv 131 seen

milestone worldstone-chamber
  use sor
  deadline 80
  poke 5 warp 132
  need player lv == 132
  need unit ut 1 cl 544 present

milestone baal-killed
  use sor
  deadline 200
  poke 5 warp 132
  poke 30 pos @1:544 @x+3 @y
  poke 30 stat @1:544 6 0 256
  poke 40 missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y skill 36 1
  need ever unit ut 1 cl 544 killed
